  "name": "Spicy Black Bean Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty pressure-cooker soup with smoky chile heat",
  "description": "Dry black beans simmer with peppers, aromatics, and warm spices, then blend into a thick vegan soup finished with fresh toppings and lime.",
